a13caa4885f547c8d206265b031ba7649e539fd9:docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_UNDER_ONE_RECORD_PER_SITE_A_COLLISION_CHANGES_THE_RECORDS_TWO_STEP_MOMENTUM_ONLY_AT_THIRD_ORDER_IN_THEIR_OFFSETS_FROM_THE_CONES_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-26.md:82:The singlet projector has rank one, so sandwiching the uniformly regular supported operator gives `⟨u′|s⟩ τ ⟨s|u⟩ + O(qR)`. For symmetric pairs the same restriction uses the triplet projector; only the additional rotation covariance makes its three-dimensional amplitude scalar. Thus, **conditioned on the same-corner channel**, the leading outgoing angular distribution agrees with the contact comparison when that leading amplitude is nonzero. The error changes a cubic observable at fourth or higher total offset order under these regularity and fixed-ratio scaling hypotheses.
a13caa4885f547c8d206265b031ba7649e539fd9:docs/ADMISSIBILITY_SIX_NEIGHBOR_AFFINE_CQ_CHANNEL_SOLDER_SUPPORT_BOUNDARY_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-08-14.md:4:claim_scope: "On the six actual nearest-neighbor Record slots, a supplied diagonal spatial-to-Pauli soldering plus affine proper-cubic covariance leaves exactly one occupancy-to-Bloch intertwiner, proportional to the opposite-slot difference d. Complete positivity on all 64 occupancy conditions bounds but does not select its scalar: alpha=1/3 and alpha=1/4 are distinct strict CPTP channels. Without a soldering, independent internal naturality kills every occupancy-only Bloch response. Uniformly averaging the six actual M_2(C) contents is CPTP and covariant as an output-only channel, but it consumes the inputs: the rank-one identity-channel Choi marginal proves that a CPTP extension preserving the full M_2 state space pointwise has constant complementary output. Nontrivial permanent access across the full M_2 possibility domain therefore requires a supplied classical/commuting Record interface. Even at the Block85 alpha=1/3 barycenter, the spectral and axis-slot ensemble lifts have identical barycenters and disjoint support at d=(1,1,0), while product and shared-latent copulas have identical fixed one-site marginals and different histories. Therefore affine/CPTP locality does not derive the Record-access quotient, soldering, response scale, ensemble lift, or conditional copula. The nonduplicative conditional hierarchy is Q_R -> J -> alpha -> mu_d -> C_R; its one-step response/coupling cut is conditional on formation, and whether Q_R is existing Record/Admissibility interpretation or needs a narrow interface clarification remains an owner decision. This is a bounded channel-classification and exact decision cut, not a universal microscopic nonderivability theorem, complete dynamics, law adoption, axiom amendment, retention, obligation retirement, or TOE percentage movement."
